.env
# D-WS7-219 — reviewed backfill sheets are COMMITTED.
# `scripts/output/` (directory form) is wrong here: git does not descend into an
# excluded directory, so a later negation can never re-include anything inside
# it. `scripts/output/*` excludes the CONTENTS instead, which leaves the negation
# below able to fire. Every other artefact in there (dry-run scratch, JSON dumps)
# stays ignored.
scripts/output/*
!scripts/output/*.csv
